# homelab-scripts — service list, shared by http-check and cert-check
# One service per line:  name|url
#
#   http-check   checks the status code of every entry
#   cert-check   checks the TLS expiry of the https:// entries (SNI = hostname)
#
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.

forge|https://forge.example.lab
sso|https://sso.example.lab
wiki|https://wiki.example.lab
media|https://media.example.lab
metrics|https://metrics.example.lab
dns|http://10.0.0.10:5380
logs|http://10.0.0.40:3100/ready
